EPUB Studio is an independent Electron implementation informed by the behavior and
feature model of Sigil and PageEdit. Sigil and PageEdit are free software projects
licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later.

No Qt/C++ source from Sigil or PageEdit is compiled into EPUB Studio. Their source
repositories remain in reference/ for feature study and provenance.

